{"type":"after","callId":"tmpm@87","endTime":1314240.673,"result":{"value":"Skip to main content\nUAE AI Intelligence — Concept Demonstration\n·\nNot an official government system\n· Public-source data, as of 21 Oct 2026 · No government logo or endorsement implied\nUAE AI Command Centre\nCONCEPT DEMONSTRATION\nUAE AI National Intelligence Command Centre — concept demonstration, not an official government system\nHome\nNational Overview\nWatchlist\nSentiment Universe\nNews Intelligence\nTech Radar\nEcosystem Graph\nExecutive Chat\nNational Briefing\nArtifacts\nMethodology\nSettings\nSearch ⌘K\nDark\nNamespace\nuae_cc_v1\n50 orgs · 196 voices · 105 news\n\nNATIONAL OVERVIEW · AS OF 21 OCT 2026\n\nUAE AI National Intelligence Command Centre\n\nA concept demonstration of how public-source signals about the UAE AI ecosystem — organisations, announcements, models and public discourse — can be fused into one command view. Every figure links back to its source; gaps are shown as gaps.\n\nGenerate National AI Briefing\nAsk the analyst\n\nORGANISATIONS\n\n50\n\n34 independent ecosystems (parents ⊃ subsidiaries de-duplicated)\n\nRESEARCH COVERAGE\n\n73%\n\n45/50 with a verified source URL\n\nPUBLIC STATEMENTS\n\n196\n\n43 explicit-UAE · 15 platforms\n\nNEWS EVENTS\n\n105\n\n27 in the last 30 days\n\nOPEN MODELS (HF)\n\n154\n\ntiiuae · inception42 · IFM · MBZUAI\n\nRELATIONSHIPS\n\n168\n\n104 nodes\n\nNational Pulse — public discourse by class\nOpen Sentiment Universe →\nOptimists\n37\nPragmatists\n20\nSkeptics\n19\nSafety Advocates\n14\nDisruption Concerned\n8\nPessimists/Doomers\n3\nNeutral/Informational\n95\n\nSampling disclaimer: Sentiment records are a purposive sample of public, attributable statements gathered via OnDemand research plugins (Perplexity, GPT Search, Internet search, Reddit/HN pages surfaced by those tools) between 2025-08 and 2026-10-20. It is NOT a population survey and does not measure national opinion.\n\nJobs & skills is the most contested topic: 35 statements, of which 9 skeptical or disruption-concerned.\n\nWatchlist composition\nCompany\n20\nSubsidiary\n14\nGovernment\n12\nResearch Centre\n2\nUniversity\n2\n\nIdentity check: OFFICIAL_ASSET_NOT_PERMITTED / NOT_FOUND — no government logo is used; this is a concept identity.\n\nPolicy anchor: the UAE Cabinet created the Artificial Intelligence and Data Authority on 2026-06-14, led by H.E. Omar Sultan Al Olama.\n\nLatest signals (last 30 days)\nAll news →\n2026-12-07\nGITEX GLOBAL 2026 scheduled for 7–11 December 2026 at Expo City Dubai (moved from October / DWTC)\n\nGITEX · —\n\n2026-10-15\nJais 3 announcedunverified\n\nsource unverified · —\n\n2026-10-15\nUAE launches Jais 3 Arabic-native AI\n\nGulf News · Inception (Inception42, G42), Mohamed bin Zayed University of Artificial Intelligence\n\n2026-10-15\nJais 3 Arabic-native AI model announced\n\nGulf News · Inception (Inception42, G42), Mohamed bin Zayed University of Artificial Intelligence\n\n2026-10-15\nMBZUAI’s Institute of Foundation Models and Inception42 launch Jais 3\n\nMBZUAI · Cerebras Systems, Inception (Inception42, G42), Mohamed bin Zayed University of Artificial Intelligence\n\n2026-10-14\nInception describes AI-assisted investment and procurement workflows at SIF 2026\n\nWAM · Inception (Inception42, G42)\n\n2026-10-07\nFalcon-Emirati 7B announcedunverified\n\nsource unverified · Technology Innovation Institute\n\n2026-10-07\nFalcon-Emirati model launched\n\nGulf Business · Advanced Technology Research Council, Technology Innovation Institute\n\nMost-cited organisations\nG42\n29 news\nKD\nKhazna Data Centers\n11 news\nM\nM42\n9 news\nMB\nMohamed bin Zayed University of Artificial Intelligence\n8 news\nC\nCore42\n8 news\nTI\nTechnology Innovation Institute\n7 news\nI\nInception (Inception42, G42)\n6 news\nMicropolis Robotics\n6 news\n\nIntelligence engine: OnDemand (AIREV) · Agents Flow Builder execution store\n\nLive pipeline — scheduled OnDemand workflows\nnamespace uae_cc_v1\n\nReading the workflow execution store…\n\nTechnology & Innovation Radar — snapshot\nOpen radar →\n\nAgentic AI in government\n\nASSESS · 18 signals · latest 2026-10-15\n\nAI data centres & compute\n\nASSESS · 17 signals · latest 2026-10\n\nArabic & sovereign LLMs\n\nADOPT · 15 signals · latest 2026-10-15\n\nAI chips & export controls\n\nADOPT · 15 signals · latest 2026-10-20\n\nRobotics & autonomy\n\nADOPT · 11 signals · latest 2026-09-30\n\nHealth & document AI\n\nADOPT · 10 signals · latest 2026-10-07\n\nSovereign cloud\n\nADOPT · 6 signals · latest 2026-09\n\nAI governance & regulation\n\nADOPT · 5 signals · latest 2026-10-07\n\nConcept Demonstration — not an official government system. Public sources only · no government logo or endorsement implied.\nData namespace uae_cc_v1 · as of 2026-10-21 · Methodology & limitations\nIntelligence engine: OnDemand (AIREV)\nv1.0.0 · local · last updated 2026-10-21 10:29 UTC"}}
